uplink-paperwork-hater-name = "I Hate Paperwork" Stamp
uplink-paperwork-hater-desc = For the seasoned paperwork hater. A stamp with an electric cigarette lighter embedded into it. Will Ignite any paper stamped with it.

uplink-chainsmoker-bundle-name = Chainsmoker Bundle.
uplink-chainsmoker-bundle-desc = A Carton of 6 Packs of Interdyne Herbals, plus a weaponized flippo that turns welding fuel into incendiary shots.

uplink-mobcat-C4-name = SyndiCat C4 Bundle
uplink-mobcat-C4-desc = Call in a loyal cat and strap a C4 to them! Bundle comes with a block of C-4, syndicat reinforcement radio , advanced remote signaller, and multitool. Watch out, this kitty bites hard!

uplink-mobcat-desc = Call in a loyal cat equipped without explosives! Scare security with your 'harmless' pet. Can bite painfully.

uplink-blood-red-super-synth-name = Blood Red Super Synth
uplink-blood-red-super-synth-desc = Play any kind of songs while exploding anything in your path.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-1-name = Outfit Bundle: Casual Fridays
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-1-desc = Every day is casual friday with these very casual clothes! Quantity of 3.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-2-name = Outfit Bundle: Guy
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-2-desc = No one knows what they do. But theyre everywhere. And whatever it is they do, they do it menacingly. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-3-name = Outfit Bundle: Engineer
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-3-desc = Whether its building weapons, torture chambers, or drinking beer, anyone will be awe struck by your style AND work place safety. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-4-name = Outfit Bundle: RND
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-4-desc = The perfect outfit for exploding violently in the most avoidable way! Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-5-name = Outfit Bundle: Surgeon
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-5-desc = If only we could actually perform surgeries.. You can atleast stab people with saws however. Win win. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-6-name = Outfit Bundle: Interdyne Specialist
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-6-desc = PPE is sexy. Comes with a Interdyne brand Flippo lighter. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-7-name = Outfit Bundle: Roboticist
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-7-desc = Making robots has always been fashionable in the color pink! Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-8-name = Outfit Bundle: Paramedic
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-8-desc = Syndicate HQ found a few spare red shirts laying around and decided to package them. High command trusts you're creative enough to find a use. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-9-name = Outfit Bundle: Cybersun Enthusiast
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-9-desc = Show off your inner cyberpunk with this derivative work of fashion! Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-10-name = Outfit Bundle: Syndicate Enthusiast
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-10-desc = Buy yourself and all of your friends merch straight from syndie land! Suit sensors included. What just because you want to support a terrorist organization doesnt mean you should die in maints for it. Quantity of 3.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-11-name = Outfit Bundle: Lawyer
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-11-desc = Represent your favorite corporation with this patented cybersun lawyering uniform. Comes in a suitcase for maximum lawyering. Quantity of 1.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-12-name = Outfit Bundle: Commander
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-12-desc = Comes with authentic (replicas) of syndicate high command formal wear. Includes flash protection, insulating gloves, combat boots and even a syndicate PDA. All in a real syndicate backpack so you can pretend you're important enough to be wearing this regularly.

uplink-cosmetic-bundle-13-name = Outfit Bundle: Mercenary
uplink-cosmetic-bundle-13-desc = Comes with everything in olive drab for you and your friends. Comes included with flash protection, insulating gloves, and combat boots. Real guns and armor sold separately.
